("v239", "key", "conclusion")
("v240", "type", "String")
("v240", "scalar", "All published application scripts belong to admitted bundles. Legacy application JavaScript is absent from publication and build execution. The finite numerical examples and workshop edits, overlays, HTML, diffs and refusals match their predecessor; the real interfaces pass the recorded browser cases.")
("v239", "value", "v240")
("v0", "entry", "v241")
("v241", "type", "Entry")
("v241", "key", "limits")
("v242", "type", "Sequence")
("v243", "type", "String")
("v243", "scalar", "Native JavaScript implements the existing kernel and explicit generic effects. No application-specific JavaScript interpreter, kernel primitive or budget extension was introduced.")
("v242", "item", "v243")
("v244", "type", "String")
("v244", "scalar", "Finite cases do not establish equivalence for every possible value, host or event interleaving.")
("v242", "item", "v244")
("v245", "type", "String")
("v245", "scalar", "Comparison runs, source snapshots and browser observations from this migration are one effective engineering evidence family.")
("v242", "item", "v245")
("v246", "type", "String")
("v246", "scalar", "This receipt records local pre-deployment qualification; deployment is verified separately.")
